{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1033827-the-genesis-corporation","id":1033827,"title":"The Genesis Corporation.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-17T19:25:18-08:00","id":1033827,"title":"The Genesis Corporation.","content":"<br /> Vic woke up. It was a sunny Saturday morning and he had work in a few hours. Before hoping into the shower, Vic turned on the TV and what he saw on the news angered him. There was a protest going on at a Genesis lab. Apparently, somebody organized the protest after hearing about the corporation\u2019s plans to start looking into ways to clone crops. As a stockholder in the company, Vic was angry that these people had the nerve to protest about scientific advancement. A few minutes later, the news was reporting another protest happening at a forest where Genesis was planning on building a new lab. The protestors were blocking the construction site and were keeping the workers from entering the site. Vic then turned off the tv and pulled out his cellphone. Eventually, a hefty sound man answered the phone with a grunt. Vic knew who it was immediately. It was James \u201cFatty\u201d Robertson, Genesis\u2019 CFO. Vic then said to him,\u201d Listen Jimmy! Those damn activists are at it again. You better do something about it or you can kiss my investment goodbye.\u201d Vic then hung up and went into the shower.<br /> <br /> James sighed as he watched the TV. Those damn activists were ruining everything. The first group was complaining about the new crop cloning program while the other group was protesting the construction of a new lab. James then pulled out his cell phone and said into it,\u201d Alright boys, let it rip.\u201d Suddenly, the protestors at the lab where being sprayed with fire hoses. James let out a light chuckle. After Vic called and bitched to him about the protestors, James had called in an old favor the Boston fire chief had owed him. He then looked at the second group of protestors the news was covering. Suddenly, a bunch of police men wearing riot gear showed up and started to arrest the protestors. James then thought to himself,\u201d It\u2019s amazing what a well-placed bribe can do.\u201d James then left his office, satisfied that he did his part to keep an investor happy.<br /> <br /> The Genesis Corporation. This company has been on the news more than once. Which is surprising since the company is barely 20 years old. The company, which is more of a scientific think-tank, does research in cloning and cloning technologies. The goal of the company, as stated by it\u2019s founder, Jahnu Narang, is to achieve mankind\u2019s immortality through cloning. This statement has led many people to accuse of the company of playing God. The Technocracy is also suspicious of this company. Not because of the whole playing God accusation. But, their timetable has not accounted for a company to start this kind of research. This has especially angered the Progenitors who think they should be the ones who introduce humanity to cloning. A couple of the Traditions also have a beef with Genesis. Specifically The Celestial Chorus and the Verbena. The Chorus accuses them of trying to create life when it is the One\u2019s job while the Verbena hates them for breaking the natural order. They have also earned the enmity of the Garou Nation who thinks they are stepping over the bounds Gaia intended for man. <br /> <br /> The company may appear squeaky clean but they are not a paragon of Corporate America. Among their shady practices are buying out potential critics, breaking up protests against them, and other practices that have yet to be uncovered. But, if you were to dig deeper into the company While these arguments may be unfounded, the company is by no means a paragon of corporate, you would find a twisted cesspool of corruption, avarice, and eventually murder. This is no surprise considering that the majority stockholder of the company is a Malfean Nephandi who goes by the name Herman Grusselman. This foul servant of the Wyrm has managed to turn a company with good intentions into a monster.<br /> <br /> To understand how this could\u2019ve happened you need to look at the company\u2019s past. Before Genesis was conceived, the founder, Jahnu Narang, was a respected biologist who taught at Oxford University. In 1989, Jahnu was offered a job at Developmental Neogenetics Amalgamated, or DNA to supervise their new cloning program. Jahnu, who was an advocate for cloning, took the job. However, the project became very costly and some of the scientists found Jahnu hard to work with. In 1992, DNA became aware of GLS and immediately pulled half the funding from the cloning program to researching this new disease. Jahnu was pissed. He thought DNA just made up the disease just to find an excuse to cut funding from his project. But, Jahnu continued to work at DNA until 1995. On that year, DNA told them that they were cancelling the cloning program and moving all the researchers to different programs. Jahnu himself was told that he was going to reassigned to the GLS program. This pissed Jahnu off so much that he left DNA and took his research notes, along with half his staff with him. The year after, The Genesis Corporation was founded.<br /> <br /> The company was immediately beset with problems. They lacked the funding DNA was used too and their only lab lacked the scientific tools needed to make cloning possible. So, in desperation, Jahnu went out and started to look for investors. At first, it looked like his trip was going to end in disappointment. But, on the final day of his trip, he was stopped by a man named Herman Grusselman. Grusselman told Jahnu he also had an interest in cloning and offered to give a $500,000 investment for a 75% stake in the company. Jahnu, agreed, not knowing Grusselman\u2019s sinister secret. Grusselman was a Nephandi.<br /> <br /> Grusselman who was a Barabbus who converted to the Nephandi cause from the Syndicate, smelled opportunity to serve the goals of himself and his master, The Wyrm. To protect his new investment, Grusselman sent in a lower ranked Nephandi by the name of Carl Smith to supervise the company as Security Director. With this new investment, the company went to work and in 2001 they released their first breakthrough into the market, Cloned miniature vegetables called \u201c Microveges\u201d. Even though this product proved to be fad it proved two things. One, Genesis was able to clone produce. Two, they would someday have the capability of cloning more than vegetables.<br /> <br /> While the company was enjoying a moderate success with microveges they were completely unaware of the corruption seeping through the company. Grusselman and Smith slowly spreaded corruption through the company, spreading it slowly and methodically to prevent detection from the Technocracy or Traditions. They also started to replace the board of directors with more \u201cquestionable\u201d people. Among these were James \u201cFatty\u201d Robertson, a former mobster, Bill Clive, a paraplegic scientist with a mysterious past and Alex Wilks, a man with multiple personalities. These men, along with two other and Jahnu as the chairman make up the modern day Board of Directors. Over the years the company released more cloned food products like Jumbo Apples and Mini Melons, while still looking for a way to clone an animal or human being.<br /> <br /> In 2007, the company made the news when they cloned a ape named Chester. This announcement concerned both the Technocracy and certain groups within the Traditions. The Technocracy were concerned with the fact that the company was going past their set timetable for cloning . The Traditonalist opposition mainly came from the Celestial Chorus, Verbena and The Euthanatos. In 2008, Jahnu finally succumbed to the taint of the Wyrm, thus making the upper management of the company complete servants of the Wyrm and it\u2019s Malfean servant. Grusselman, satisfied that the company was brought down to his level, ordered the cloning research project to go on faster than the scientist were used to. In 2014, Genesis faced it\u2019s first tragedy when a fire happened in one of their labs in Arizona. This fire killed 5 researchers and destroyed valuable research. The board was angered and immediately sent people to investigate what torched the lab. What they came back with angered them even more. A man in a black suit was seen torching the building . Herman, who realized this was a NWO agent immedialty started to grill every single employee in order to find a mole in the company. The search proved invalid. What followed was a year of one tragedy after another. Among these were the slaying of Ravi Cashel, a board member, at the hand of a Euthanatoes and two more labs being torched. In the current year, Genesis is continuing it\u2019s cloning program in hopes of one day cloning a human. Their current goal however, is a attempt to clone human organs and program them with a fail safe that allows them to shut down after a few years, making transplant victims pay more money to get a replacement.<br /> <br /> What do you guys think of both the opening foction and the company itself?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}